        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.38",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "Oh I think uh , if I'm not wrong , we're making the remote control .",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.D.dialog-act.s9553330.22",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "Remote controls ,",
        "participant": "MIE085",
        "role": "ME"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.D.dialog-act.s9553330.26",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "we'll start with the remote control for television then .",
        "participant": "MIE085",
        "role": "ME"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.D.dialog-act.s9553330.27",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "So we're have to design something that is very user friendly .",
        "participant": "MIE085",
        "role": "ME"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.40",
        "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
        "text": "Mm-hmm .",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.D.dialog-act.s9553330.21",
        "participant": "MIE085",
        "role": "ME",
        "text": "is that right ?"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.B.dialog-act.s9553330.4",
        "participant": "FIE038",
        "role": "UI",
        "text": "Um I was wondering <disfmarker>"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.D.dialog-act.s9553330.23",
        "participant": "MIE085",
        "role": "ME",
        "text": "'cause I had two different things ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.39",
        "participant": "MIO086",
        "role": "PM",
        "text": "<vocalsound> Yes ."
      },
      {
        "da_id": "IS1008a.B.dialog-act.s9553330.5",
        "participant": "FIE038",
        "role": "UI",
        "text": "Mm-hmm ."
      }
    ],
    "peer_items": [
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#0",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "Deliver written project plan by next meeting."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#1",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "The industrial designer (FIE073) will deliver a written project plan including functional and technical design, required team, timeline and initial budget within two weeks, and identify contributors from marketing, technical and administration who will contribute to the plan."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#2",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "The user interface designer (FIE038) will determine the functional design, discuss with Ed to ensure usability and user acceptance, and coordinate usability testing with Christine's team."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#3",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "Jointly develop plan including cost and market strategy to compete."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#4",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "Project goal and scope are unclear, with conflicting ideas (remote control vs coffee); there is no functional or technical design yet, no project plan, roles and responsibilities are not defined, and documentation is lacking, hindering presentation to management and securing funding."
      }
